=== hmmer
--- hmmsearch --tb
--tblout=	save parseable table of per-sequence hits to file <f>
--- hmmsearch data/
data/pfam.hmm 
data/sub/
--- hmmsearch data/pfam.hmm data/
data/db.faa 
data/q.fa 
data/sub/
--- hmmsearch --tblout data/
data/aln.sto 
data/aln.sto.gz 
data/db.faa 
data/notes.txt 
data/pfam.hmm 
data/q.fa 
data/sub/
--- hmmsearch --cut_
--cut_ga 	use profile's GA gathering cutoffs to set all thresholding
--cut_nc 	use profile's NC noise cutoffs to set all thresholding
--cut_tc 	use profile's TC trusted cutoffs to set all thresholding
--- hmmsearch -E
-E 	report sequences <= this E-value threshold in output
--- hmmscan --domtblout 
bio_hmmer.sh 
data/
